{"id":1141103,"name":"픽셀·심문 III","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"픽셀·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1141103]}],"trial":{"trial_id":141103,"stage":"3단계","unlock_time":"2026-08-07 14:00:00","diary1":"비트만과의 대치 속에서, 픽셀의 정신 상태는 위태로웠다.","diary2":"총성이 울리자, 픽셀은 신성에서 가장 혼잡한 인파 속으로 흔적 없이 사라졌다.\n　　더 많은 사람이 빛 속에 머물 수 있도록 어떤 이는 어둠 속으로 걸어 들어간다. 당신은 그녀가 반드시 돌아올 거라 믿었다. 그때가 되면 그녀는 '루시'라는 이름으로 집 문을 열고 들어가, 엄마가 끓여준 차를 한 잔 마실 것이다.","evidence":[{"ID":260967,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260968,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241103024,"next"